## 2. Tech Stack Mapping (v2.0)

| Layer | Technology | Purpose | New in v2.0 |
|---|---|---|---|
| UI / Presentation | SwiftUI | Declarative native UI | Enhanced views |
| Business Logic | Swift ViewModels | State, validation, orchestration | New ViewModels |
| Navigation | NavigationStack + TabView | Routing | Role-based tabs |
| Data Models | Swift Codable Structs | Typed data structures | New models |
| Backend Services | supabase-swift SDK | DB queries, Auth | New operations |
| Secure Logic | Supabase Edge Functions (Deno) | Server-side processing | 5 new functions |
| Payments (One-time) | Razorpay iOS SDK | Payment sheet | Same as v1.0 |
| Payments (Recurring) | Razorpay Subscriptions API | Monthly plans | ✅ New |
| File Storage | Supabase Storage | Documents, receipts | ✅ New |
| PDF Generation | Deno PDF library | 80G receipt PDFs | ✅ New |
| AI Integration | LLM API | Impact reports | ✅ New |
| Image Loading | AsyncImage | Campaign images | ✅ New |
| PDF Display | PDFKit | Receipt viewing | ✅ New |
| Dependency Mgt | Swift Package Manager | SDK versions | Same as v1.0 |

