## 4. Navigation Architecture (v2.0)

```
App Entry (DonateNowApp.swift)
   │
   ├── if Anonymous / Donor
   │      └── TabView
   │             ├── Tab 1: NavigationStack { MarketplaceView → CampaignDetailView → DonationView → ThankYouView }
   │             ├── Tab 2: NavigationStack { DonationHistoryView → ReceiptDetailView }
   │             └── Tab 3: ProfileView / LoginView
   │
   ├── if Creator
   │      └── TabView
   │             ├── Tab 1: NavigationStack { MarketplaceView → CampaignDetailView → DonationView → ThankYouView }
   │             ├── Tab 2: NavigationStack { MyCampaignsView → CreateCampaignView / EditCampaignView }
   │             ├── Tab 3: NavigationStack { CreatorDashboardView → CampaignDonationLogView / ImpactReportView }
   │             └── Tab 4: ProfileView (+ SubscriptionManageView / ReceiptListView)
   │
   └── if Admin
          └── TabView
                 ├── Tab 1: NavigationStack { MarketplaceView → CampaignDetailView }
                 ├── Tab 2: NavigationStack { AdminVerificationQueue → CampaignReviewView }
                 ├── Tab 3: NavigationStack { AdminDashboardView → DonorLogView }
                 └── Tab 4: ProfileView
```

