## 7. Build & Deployment Architecture

| Environment | Purpose | Infrastructure |
|---|---|---|
| Development | Local development | Xcode Simulator (iPhone + iPad) |
| Backend Dev | Edge Function development | Supabase CLI (`supabase functions serve`) |
| Staging | Integration testing | Supabase project (staging) |
| Production | Live platform | Supabase project (production) |
| Distribution | App delivery | TestFlight / App Store (requires dev account) |

### Deployment Sequence
1. Run migration scripts on staging database
2. Deploy new Edge Functions via `supabase functions deploy`
3. Configure Storage buckets
4. Build and test iOS app on Simulator
5. Validate migration with test data
6. Promote to production (when ready)
